@ref reg 39(3) (src:751-754)
GIVEN facts IS A `Sch 6 claimant facts`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`reg 39(3) — the points scored in Part 1 of Schedule 6` facts MEANS
    sum (LIST
        `reg 39(4) and (5) — the points counted for Sch 6 activity 1` facts,
        `reg 39(4) and (5) — the points counted for Sch 6 activity 2` facts,
        `reg 39(4) and (5) — the points counted for Sch 6 activity 3` facts,
        `reg 39(4) and (5) — the points counted for Sch 6 activity 4` facts,
        `reg 39(4) and (5) — the points counted for Sch 6 activity 5` facts,
        `reg 39(4) and (5) — the points counted for Sch 6 activity 6` facts,
        `reg 39(4) and (5) — the points counted for Sch 6 activity 7` facts,
        `reg 39(4) and (5) — the points counted for Sch 6 activity 8` facts,
        `reg 39(4) and (5) — the points counted for Sch 6 activity 9` facts,
        `reg 39(4) and (5) — the points counted for Sch 6 activity 10` facts)

